      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## NAG demo — Reference to video (Pika H3 Flex REF2VA)\n\nRequires [ComfyUI-NAG-MiniMaxH3](https://github.com/BenderBlender/ComfyUI-NAG-MiniMaxH3).\n\nThree branches share the same models, inputs, seed, sampler and sigmas, so the three videos differ only by guidance:\n\n1. **Without NAG** — the original ComfyUI template (`BasicGuider`).\n2. **NAG, empty negative prompt** — `NAGGuider (MiniMax H3)` with an empty NAG negative prompt.\n3. **NAG, negative prompt** — `NAGGuider (MiniMax H3)` with a filled NAG negative prompt.\n\nPika H3 Flex samples in 6 steps without CFG, so the NAG negative prompt is its only negative control.\n\n**Tuning:** start from `nag_scale` 5, `nag_tau` 2.5, `nag_alpha` 0.25. Find a `nag_tau` / `nag_alpha` pair without artifacts first, then tune only `nag_scale`. For reference images, lower `nag_tau` and `nag_alpha` keep the references faithful.\n\nRunning all three branches takes three to four times as long as the original template (NAG adds a second attention pass): mute the ones you don't need (Ctrl+M).\n\nBased on the ComfyUI template *Pika H3 Flex: Reference to Video*.\n"
      ],
